Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.66,0:00:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Waves are holding steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.83,0:00:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The drugs have made\Nher nerves super sensitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.17,0:00:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, no signs of inversion. Crank it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.98,0:00:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Nightmare's attacking!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.60,0:00:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Call for backup from Implement 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.40,0:01:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally found you,\NSecond Spirit... "Sister."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.26,0:02:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're reading typical Spirit Wave levels.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.56,0:02:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The path connecting you\Nand the Spirits has normalized.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.02,0:02:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? That's a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.65,0:02:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You had me worried\Nwith your rampage the other day,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.48,0:03:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,but I think it's safe\Nto resume regular checkups.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.49,0:03:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for all the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.57,0:03:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Though, I can't even\Nremember what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.67,0:03:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido! Is your checkup done?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.46,0:03:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tohka. Yeah, it went fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.88,0:03:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That's wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.59,0:03:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.22,0:03:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshino's been worried sick! She was\Nholding Natsumi's hand the whole time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.52,0:03:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. Sorry to trouble you, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.65,0:03:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be. It's not like we did anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.57,0:03:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't your checkups next?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.86,0:03:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll buy stuff for dinner\Non the way home, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.91,0:03:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Where's Kotori?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.58,0:03:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, she's busy with\Nsomething in Exam Room 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.21,0:03:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry and you might catch her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.46,0:03:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. See you guys later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.67,0:04:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,--Okay!\N--Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.68,0:04:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Exam Room 2...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.22,0:04:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's this one, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.93,0:04:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm your butt down and let me strip you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.23,0:04:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,K-Kotori?! Mana?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.15,0:04:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,--Big brother!\N--Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.07,0:04:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sorry for intruding,\Nbut it's wrong to force her into it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.78,0:04:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You've totally got the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.62,0:04:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotori is forcing me to get a checkup!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.46,0:04:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.00,0:04:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing wrong with me!\NAnd why do I have to listen to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.55,0:04:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you! You need an exam with all\Nthe body enhancements DEM's done to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.93,0:04:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My body's fine, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.26,0:04:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But you keep stopping me from going\Non missions! I wanna help out, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.89,0:04:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let me exam you! I'll discover stuff\Nabout your body you never knew!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.94,0:05:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Big brother! Save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.20,0:05:15.58,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Happy New Year"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.04,0:05:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody has a clue there's\Na huge secret base under all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.35,0:05:31.35,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Blast"\N"Serial Publication"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.60,0:05:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.81,0:05:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.32,0:05:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A-Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.32,0:05:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Ar... ving.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.03,0:05:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Wh-What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.53,0:05:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm... starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.45,0:05:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.54,0:06:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.46,0:06:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course. Say, do you want me\Nto take you to the hospital?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.34,0:06:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, heck no. It's not like I'm sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.68,0:06:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, can you talk less polite?\NIt feels so stiff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.35,0:06:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.89,0:06:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go again. But anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.77,0:06:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been pushing 'em on you to show\Nmy thanks, but you haven't reacted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.03,0:06:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you a butt guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.08,0:06:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.33,0:06:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Or a big boob lover that thinks\Nanything under 80cm doesn't count?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.04,0:06:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry that my stack doesn't cut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.63,0:06:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you not put me in weird groups?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.84,0:06:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. This building, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.10,0:06:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.27,0:06:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oof! Whew!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.14,0:07:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.65,0:07:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you a manga artist?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.69,0:07:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it. Was working so hard,\NI forgot to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.12,0:07:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I was heading to the store to buy food\Nwhen I found out how strong gravity is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.29,0:07:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.37,0:07:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this what I think it is?!\N{\i1}Silver Bullet?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.09,0:07:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you knew.\NAre you a reader? Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.09,0:07:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold up! That makes you\Nthe author, Souji Honjo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.68,0:07:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.97,0:07:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You're not a guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.98,0:07:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my pen name.\NMy real one's Nia. Nia Honjo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.23,0:07:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,There's quite a few women using\Nguy pen names to write {\i1}shonen{\i0} manga.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.53,0:07:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, like {\i1}Other Fake{\i0}'s Takajo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.32,0:07:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha--?! Hiroki Takajo, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.20,0:07:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, it doesn't make sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.66,0:08:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I read {\i1}Silver Bullet{\i0}\Nin elementary school.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.75,0:08:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And the author stopped writing\Nfor health reasons years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.96,0:08:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been ten years since my debut...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.92,0:08:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I was out for a few reasons,\Nbut I'm starting back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.59,0:08:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Check out the next volume. It'll be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.14,0:08:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten years ago?\NBut you don't even look 20 yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.27,0:08:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,B-Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.44,0:08:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah. Lemme borrow your kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.16,0:08:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Delicious! Delicious! What is this\Nculinary magic?! What is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.29,0:08:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of life do you live?\NAll you have is beer in the fridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.21,0:08:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Man! I haven't had a hot meal\Nlike this in a week!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.67,0:08:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll clean up and leave, so try not\Nto starve and collapse again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.59,0:09:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, now! Not so fast, Boy!\NYou wanna earn some money?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.31,0:09:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I even doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.27,0:09:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry. I don't usually use assistants,\Nbut the deadline is tight this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.65,0:09:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine, but what's the outfit for?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.91,0:09:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,For reference, but also as\Nspecial thanks for your service!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.83,0:09:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! I've got no boobs,\Nbut don't I got style?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.25,0:09:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Here. Is this good enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.13,0:09:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez! Trying to play cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.63,0:09:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, you're not bad!\NMore of where that came from!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.68,0:09:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.26,0:09:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,All done!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.47,0:09:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't focused that hard in ages!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.19,0:09:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for all the help!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.19,0:09:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Here! Come get your pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.36,0:09:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.65,0:09:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so fussy! C'mon, c'mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.15,0:09:56.40,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Pay"\N"Boy"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.49,0:10:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Is having small boobs a sin?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.66,0:10:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... I'm leaving for real, so keep\Nthe money. It was a learning experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.42,0:10:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Wait! That won't sit right with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.47,0:10:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How about this? Next Saturday,\NI'll go on a date with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.76,0:10:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,A date?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.76,0:10:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,In Akihabara! I haven't bought\Nmuch lately, so I wanna go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.48,0:10:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm your bag carrier?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.06,0:10:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Erk!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.40,0:10:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but ask someone else.\NHow about one of your friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.07,0:10:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Gee, I don't really have\Nany friends! But still...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.58,0:10:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you afford not to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.91,0:10:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.83,0:10:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,--There we go.\N--Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.60,0:11:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it your job to make Spirits\Nfall for you, Shido Itsuka?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.82,0:11:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a month since Sister's escape...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.66,0:11:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I can punish the facility crew\Nif you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.83,0:11:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need. Our talented\Nresearchers are valuable. Besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.54,0:11:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides... What, Ike?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.84,0:11:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They couldn't have done a better job.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.18,0:11:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What gives?!\NGive a better reaction than that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.76,0:11:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,--I just transformed for you!\N--Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.98,0:11:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I was expecting a\N"Wh-What the heck?!" at least!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.98,0:11:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Or even better, "This girl's\Ntransformation made my heart skip!"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.65,0:12:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, look! My Spirit Armor\Nis sexy, don'tcha think?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.78,0:12:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey! Quit teasing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.12,0:12:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Nia, I get that you're a Spirit,\Nbut how do you know about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.12,0:12:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.83,0:12:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That you date Spirits\Nand make them fall for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.38,0:12:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Because... Raziel!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.60,0:12:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my Angel, Raziel.\NIt can see everything in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.52,0:12:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,In the world...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.48,0:12:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening anywhere in the world...\NWhat anyone is doing...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.78,0:12:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,For example,\Nhow you just finished shopping
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.20,0:12:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and were on the way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.66,0:12:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Then us meeting...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.83,0:12:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You really thought it was a coincidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.17,0:12:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That some girl you found on the ground\Nturned out to be a Spirit?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.92,0:13:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,A story that bad I don't want any part of.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.17,0:13:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So you purposely collapsed\Nknowing I'd help?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.43,0:13:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.35,0:13:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And made me help with\Nyour manga for a reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.60,0:13:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Just to meet the deadline.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.98,0:13:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.52,0:13:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what are you after?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.48,0:13:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not really after anything.\NI just wanted to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.61,0:13:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Until recently, I was DEM's captive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.37,0:13:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,DEM? Westcott?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.58,0:13:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup. Hence "away" for five years.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.12,0:13:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But I finally got a chance to escape,\Nand now I can get back to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.46,0:13:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Five years with DEM...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.01,0:13:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But while I was captive...\NRatatoskr, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.05,0:13:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,A secret organization\Nstarted looking for Spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.22,0:13:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... So with your Raziel,\Nyou know everything about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.65,0:14:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Not everything. Even Raziel\Ncan't read the future or people's hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.61,0:14:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But it {\i1}can{\i0} do this...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.70,0:14:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.49,0:14:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,My body's moving on its own!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.08,0:14:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Eek!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.75,0:14:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold up! What was that all about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.84,0:14:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,"Future Entry."\NEverything written in Raziel is true--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.47,0:14:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it's something added to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.06,0:14:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Future Entry?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.93,0:14:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup! The things written in\NRaziel become true.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.77,0:14:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Having said that, it can be a pain\Nto write everything out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.53,0:14:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I see. That does seem inconvenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.61,0:14:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy, you're not seeing\Nhow terrifying Raziel can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.66,0:14:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, Boy... You seem to know\Nyour way around a manga.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.21,0:15:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You've tried to\Ndraw one before, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.13,0:15:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what kind of manga it was?\NLet's ask Mr. Raziel!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.92,0:15:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.59,0:15:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh! The Black Knight, Lievan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.89,0:15:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, this girl needs some work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.85,0:15:20.31,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Flashing Thunder Wave!"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.39,0:15:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What a cool attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.43,0:15:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Flashing Thunder Wave!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.73,0:15:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All your original characters from\Nmiddle school! Talk about embarrassing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.94,0:15:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.99,0:15:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well? See how terrifying Raziel can be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.66,0:15:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's incredible!\NSorry for doubting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.08,0:15:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeing how you helped with the manga\Nand your rice soup was tasty,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.58,0:15:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd give you a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.79,0:15:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,A chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.79,0:15:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,To make me fall for you with a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.59,0:15:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think you can win me over,\Nwin me over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.47,0:15:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to next Saturday, Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.31,0:16:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Akiba! I'm home!\NHome...! Home...! Home...!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.40,0:16:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How to put this...\NYou're really decked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.20,0:16:15.07,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Tokiya"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.74,0:16:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido, you copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.41,0:16:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.04,0:16:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,She doesn't seem hostile from\Nwhat you've said, but be on your guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.96,0:16:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it. Let's raise her happiness today\Nbefore DEM finds her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.67,0:16:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, sorry about the makeshift\Ncommand room,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.22,0:16:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,but bear with it\Nuntil Fraxinus is repaired.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.39,0:16:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,--Roger!\N--Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.43,0:16:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, shall we begin our date?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.44,0:16:46.65,On Top,,0,0,0,,"1. Cute clothes. They look good on you."\N"2. What ugly clothes. I'll buy you something new."\N"3. Oh? Those clothes will be fun to take off later."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.65,0:16:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander, we have choices!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.73,0:16:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.07,0:16:51.90,On Top,,0,0,0,,"1. Cute clothes. They look good on you."\N"2. What ugly clothes. I'll buy you something new."\N"3. Oh? Those clothes will be fun to take off later."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.11,0:16:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? That's surprising.\NThe safest choice came in third.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.16,0:16:57.91,On Top,,0,0,0,,"1. Cute clothes. They look good on you."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.16,0:17:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,'Cuz, well... How to say it?\NNia's clothes are kinda..."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.04,0:17:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,True. Complimenting that\Nget-up sounds like sarcasm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.75,0:17:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, wouldn't two be best?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.67,0:17:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,A harsh comment followed\Nby a glimpse of kindness!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.38,0:17:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Picking out her clothes is the way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.51,0:17:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No, think about it.\NNia didn't come today to buy clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.10,0:17:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Manga, light novels, figures, Blu-rays!\NThat's her goal!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.57,0:17:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Forcing her to shop for clothes\Nwould be nothing short of torture!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.49,0:17:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh! That's Nakatsugawa,\N"The Man With 100 Wives," for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.78,0:17:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Your knowledge of love\Ntranscends dimensions!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.04,0:17:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And according to Shido, she makes\Nnaughty comments all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.71,0:17:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Making a dirty joke might bring them closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.80,0:17:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido, try three.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.67,0:17:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up? Why so quiet, Boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.09,0:18:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, no... Um, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.97,0:18:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Oh? Those clothes\Nwill be fun to take off later.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.36,0:18:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.40,0:18:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.74,0:18:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanna take it all the way today?\NI didn't think you were such a player!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.37,0:18:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-That's not what I--
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.70,0:18:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You've gotta go that far to seal Spirit power?\NThen lemme change my panties.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.92,0:18:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,--Eh?!\N--I'm kidding! I'm kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.88,0:18:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're getting advice from Ratatoskr, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.14,0:18:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay! Yay! Are you watching this, Kotori?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.60,0:18:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I sure am. Very closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.23,0:18:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for carrying my stuff, Boy.\NWhat a gentleman!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.32,0:19:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.28,0:19:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoink.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.62,0:19:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,She's making all the moves, Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.74,0:19:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I dunno what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.33,0:19:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh! Target spotted!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.75,0:19:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.13,0:19:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't been here in so long,\Nit all feels so new!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.84,0:19:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you keep up to date with Raziel?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.01,0:19:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I try to refrain from using Raziel\Nwhen it's not necessary--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.68,0:19:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,'cuz I hate spoilers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.35,0:19:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Did DEM make you use it\Nwhile you were captured?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.15,0:19:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? I don't really remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.03,0:19:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? The whole five years?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.57,0:19:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They always kept tampering\Nwith my mind and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.78,0:19:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But if they had such a hard time,\NI doubt they were able to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.75,0:19:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You never used Raziel\Nto see what happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.96,0:20:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, I'd rather not.\NI know it won't be pretty anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.09,0:20:05.60,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Chronicle\NKitan Tokiya"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.26,0:20:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at all the Tokiya goods!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.14,0:20:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You like him that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.97,0:20:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,"Like" doesn't even begin to describe it!\NHe's the reason I got into manga!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.10,0:20:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Tokiya is my wife! A guy, but my wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.57,0:20:20.99,On Top,,0,0,0,,"A Boy's Club for Two"\N"Hands, Hearts, Together"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.44,0:20:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, you like this stuff, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.15,0:20:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph! Those without a\NMaiden Circuit wouldn't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.87,0:20:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that even a saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.99,0:20:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Pros in this field can perceive\Nanyone's nature in a single glance!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.96,0:20:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Timid bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.54,0:20:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! How did you classify me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.42,0:20:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The mood looks good. We haven't had\Na date go this smooth in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.05,0:20:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's about time for the next step.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.85,0:20:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that was fun! I'm satisfied!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.02,0:20:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I had a good time, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.82,0:21:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's swing by a café.\NThis way's a shortcut.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.66,0:21:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Nia!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.50,0:21:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's your chance, Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.13,0:21:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,N-Nia...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.22,0:21:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.18,0:21:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.48,0:21:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.98,0:21:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.27,0:21:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna be chased by DEM,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.28,0:21:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,so I really wouldn't mind if you sealed me...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.37,0:21:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But the truth is, I can only love 2D.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.70,0:21:54.96,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Episode 01:\N'Don't Panic. It's a Spirit's Trap.'"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.54,0:21:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.84,0:23:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The opening narration can do\Nthe episode preview. Now that's freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.34,0:23:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido's dates are again underway!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.93,0:23:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time: "So Be It! 2D It Is!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.81,0:23:41.50,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Episode 02:\N'So Be It! 2D It is!'"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.18,0:23:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Date A Live{\i0}'s fourth act has begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.45,0:23:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.44,0:23:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,
